WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.320
Welcome to Preparing You.

2
00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.694
Here's how to get started.

3
00:00:03.144 --> 00:00:06.794
On your Home screen you'll find three Introduction Videos.

4
00:00:06.794 --> 00:00:08.556
Tap the first tile to begin.

5
00:00:08.556 --> 00:00:13.905
Watch them in order — each one unlocks the next, and your progress shows on the tile.

6
00:00:13.905 --> 00:00:16.611
They explain what this is and how it works.

7
00:00:17.061 --> 00:00:22.202
Once you've watched all three, you can choose a PCM, your Personal Contact Minister.

8
00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:27.466
A real person: someone you can talk to, ask questions, and who supports you as you go.

9
00:00:27.466 --> 00:00:30.343
Open the "Choose a PCM" tile when you're ready.

10
00:00:30.793 --> 00:00:37.952
There's also a weekly Townhall — a live community call where you'll meet others on the same path, shown in your own timezone.

11
00:00:37.952 --> 00:00:41.847
You'll get a reminder before it starts, and a banner when it's live.

12
00:00:41.847 --> 00:00:42.821
Just tap to join.

13
00:00:43.271 --> 00:00:47.391
That's it: watch the videos, choose your PCM, and come to a Townhall.

14
00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:48.704
Glad to have you here.
